              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">A hand weapon, buckler, and either javelins or sling. May exchange sling or javelins for bow (+2 pts). One Regular Psiloi unit may take crossbow (+4 pts) instead of javelins/sling. Palaeologan Regular Psiloi may take light armour (+1 pt). Skirmishers. (Armies of Chivalry p.55)</characteristic>
