            <profile id="af39-6520-5c53-d811" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="da79-edc9-ea11-dbc4" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, shield and thrusting spear. May have light armour (+1 pt) or heavy armour (+2 pts). Spearmen and Crossbowmen may use Mixed Order. Latinikoi Infantry (spearmen and crossbowmen together) 0-1 unit; may only be taken if Latinikoi Knights are taken as well. (Armies of Chivalry p.55)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
