                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">See the Turkoman Cavalry entry in the Ottoman Turks list: hand weapon, shield and bow; thrusting spear (+2 pts); Skirmishers, Parthian Shot and Feigned Flight. 0-3 units. Nikaean and Palaeologan armies. (Armies of Chivalry p.55)</characteristic>
