  <sharedRules>
    <rule id="4015-bede-8fa5-fcfc" name="The Last Byzantines (Armies of Chivalry) - List Notes" publicationId="da79-edc9-ea11-dbc4" hidden="false">
      <description>THE LAST BYZANTINES 1204-1461 (Armies of Chivalry, pp.54-55). All Byzantine armies use the same army composition; unless a troop type is mentioned for a particular army it may not be used. Only troops mentioned as Permanent Mercenaries may be upgraded to Permanent Mercenaries (+2 pts per model, one Mercenary unit per 1,000 army points, +1 Leadership, no Allies &amp; Mercenaries test at the start of the first turn). Latinikoi Knights are Impetuous with First Charge.

ARMY COMPOSITIONS (pick one in the Army composition list):
[The Last Byzantines - Nikaean Byzantines (1204-1261)]
  Characters: up to 25%
  Infantry: up to 25%
  Cavalry: up to 33%
  Allies &amp; Mercenaries: up to 75%
  Characters up to 25%, Infantry up to 25%, Cavalry up to 33%, Allies &amp; Mercenaries up to 75%. Nikaean armies: Regular &amp; Elite Pronoiarios, Regular &amp; Irregular Psiloi and Hoplitai, and Turkoman Cavalry. Permanent Mercenaries: one Mercenary unit per 1,000 army points may be upgraded to Permanent Mercenaries (+2 pts per model); +1 Leadership; they do not take the Allies &amp; Mercenaries test; they still cannot use the General's Leadership or the Standard Bearer's re-roll. Permanent Mercenaries: Latinikoi and Skythikoi.
[The Last Byzantines - Trapezuntine Byzantines (1204-1461)]
  Characters: up to 25%
  Infantry: up to 25%
  Cavalry: up to 33%
  Allies &amp; Mercenaries: up to 75%
  Characters up to 25%, Infantry up to 25%, Cavalry up to 33%, Allies &amp; Mercenaries up to 75%. Regular Pronoiarios, Regular &amp; Irregular Psiloi and Hoplitai, and Barbarian Warriors. Permanent Mercenaries: one Mercenary unit per 1,000 army points may be upgraded to Permanent Mercenaries (+2 pts per model); +1 Leadership; they do not take the Allies &amp; Mercenaries test; they still cannot use the General's Leadership or the Standard Bearer's re-roll. Permanent Mercenaries: Balkan Cavalry, Mountain Tribesmen, and Skythikoi &amp; Turkopoloi.
[The Last Byzantines - Morean Byzantines (1204-1461)]
  Characters: up to 25%
  Infantry: up to 25%
  Cavalry: up to 33%
  Allies &amp; Mercenaries: up to 75%
  Characters up to 25%, Infantry up to 25%, Cavalry up to 33%, Allies &amp; Mercenaries up to 75%. Regular Pronoiarios, Regular &amp; Irregular Psiloi and Hoplitai, and Barbarian Warriors. Permanent Mercenaries: one Mercenary unit per 1,000 army points may be upgraded to Permanent Mercenaries (+2 pts per model); +1 Leadership; they do not take the Allies &amp; Mercenaries test; they still cannot use the General's Leadership or the Standard Bearer's re-roll. Permanent Mercenaries: Balkan Cavalry, Mountain Tribesmen, and one unit of Latinikoi troops.
[The Last Byzantines - Epirote Byzantines (1204-1318)]
  Characters: up to 25%
  Infantry: up to 25%
  Cavalry: up to 33%
  Allies &amp; Mercenaries: up to 75%
  Characters up to 25%, Infantry up to 25%, Cavalry up to 33%, Allies &amp; Mercenaries up to 75%. Epiriote armies: Regular &amp; Elite Pronoiarios, Regular &amp; Irregular Psiloi and Hoplitai. Permanent Mercenaries: one Mercenary unit per 1,000 army points may be upgraded to Permanent Mercenaries (+2 pts per model); +1 Leadership; they do not take the Allies &amp; Mercenaries test; they still cannot use the General's Leadership or the Standard Bearer's re-roll. Permanent Mercenaries: Latinikoi, Balkan Cavalry, and Mountain Tribesmen.
[The Last Byzantines - Palaeologan Byzantines (1259-1453)]
  Characters: up to 25%
  Infantry: up to 25%
  Cavalry: up to 33%
  Allies &amp; Mercenaries: up to 75%
  Characters up to 25%, Infantry up to 25%, Cavalry up to 33%, Allies &amp; Mercenaries up to 75%. Palaeologan armies: Guards, Elite &amp; Regular Pronoiarios, Regular &amp; Irregular Psiloi and Hoplitai, and Turkoman Cavalry. Permanent Mercenaries: one Mercenary unit per 1,000 army points may be upgraded to Permanent Mercenaries (+2 pts per model); +1 Leadership; they do not take the Allies &amp; Mercenaries test; they still cannot use the General's Leadership or the Standard Bearer's re-roll. Permanent Mercenaries: Skythikoi &amp; Turkopoloi and Alans. Palaeologan special rule: Regular Psiloi may take light armour (+1 pt).</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
</catalogue>
